      "id": "fara-impozit-danez",
      "text": "IDA's tables carry no tax schedule: no AM-bidrag, no bundskat, no kommuneskat, no personfradrag. Net pay is therefore not computed for this regime and payslip.net is null. Inventing Danish tax rates would breach the rule that every number names its source.",
